-- ===== section: xmas1 =====
-- Idempotent. Appends Christmas photos to signals.christmas_photo_gallery on EXISTING wf_inventory rows only.
-- No inserts, no new places. Year round signals.photos and photo_gallery are left alone so holiday shots never show on a place card in July.
-- Stetson Mansion and Winterfest have no place row; their photos ship as static files in detail2.patch.

